<title>USA: Paris SD 7, Ark., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Paris SD 7, Ark., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc said it won</p>
<p>$2.440 million of Paris School District No 7 of Logan county, Ark.,</p>
<p>limited tax refunding bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.298 percent.</p>
</text>
